  "worked_solution": "To compute the dot product, we add up the products of corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot v & ={u}_{1}\\cdot {v}_{1}+{u}_{2}\\cdot {v}_{2}+{u}_{3}\\cdot {v}_{3}+{u}_{4}\\cdot {v}_{4} \\\\  & =(-4)\\cdot 2+1\\cdot (-4)+2\\cdot 6+3\\cdot (-7) \\\\  & =-8-4+12-21 \\\\  & =-21\\end{aligned}\n$$",
